    "evidence": "The cyan kill-chain trace, hot-pink agentic state, dossier-like vector grid, and evidence panel create a recognizable adversary-map concept on desktop. However, tablet and mobile replace the signature trace with a plain numbered grid, while clipped columns and large empty regions make the experience resemble a dense responsive dashboard rather than a polished demo centerpiece.",
